WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.399
Before you throw, ask: does this runner have to advance?

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.007
With a runner on first, the batter makes that runner go to second.

3
00:00:10.487 --> 00:00:14.809
For that force out, hold the ball and touch second in time.

4
00:00:15.487 --> 00:00:19.852
With only a runner on second, there is no force at third.

5
00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:24.765
To get that runner out at third, tag the runner with the ball.

6
00:00:25.487 --> 00:00:29.424
A caught ball or another out can remove a force.

7
00:00:29.454 --> 00:00:30.581
Read the play.
